.TH MAKE:SEEDER 1 "SPP CLI" "Version 1.0" "SPP Manual"
.SH NAME
make:seeder \- Scaffolds a modern, fluent database seeder class extending SPPSeeder.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php make:seeder
.I <SeederName>
[\-\-app=AppName]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scaffolds a standardized database seeder class under src/{app}/seeders/{SeederName}Seeder.php. The generated seeder extends \\SPPMod\\SPPDB\\SPPSeeder and provides native entity synthesis, realistic fakes, table truncation, and workflow state fixtures.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B <SeederName>
Name of the seeder class to scaffold (e.g., UserSeeder). Suffix 'Seeder' is automatically appended if omitted.
.TP
.B \-\-app=<app_name>
(Optional) Application namespace and target directory under src/ (defaults to 'default').
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Resolves src/{app}/seeders/, verifies identifier validity, and generates the seeder PHP class file with modern SPPSeeder boilerplate.
